      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Helper class to register JSR-310 specific <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> implementations. These converters are based on\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Timestamp.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Timestamp</code></a> instead of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Date.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Date</code></a> and therefore preserve nanosecond precision",
      "translation": "这是一个用于注册 JSR-310 特定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>实现的辅助类。这些转换器基于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Timestamp.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Timestamp</code></a>而非<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Date.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Date</code></a>，因此能够保留纳秒精度。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the converters to be registered.\n\nNote that the <a href=\"Jsr310TimestampBasedConverters.LocalDateTimeToTimestampConverter.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Jsr310TimestampBasedConverters.LocalDateTimeToTimestampConverter</code></a> is not included, since many database don't need that conversion.\nDatabases that do need it, should include it in the conversions offered by their respective dialect.",
      "translation": "返回要注册的转换器。\n\n请注意，<a href=\"Jsr310TimestampBasedConverters.LocalDateTimeToTimestampConverter.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Jsr310TimestampBasedConverters.LocalDateTimeToTimestampConverter</code></a> 未被包含在内，因为许多数据库不需要这种转换。需要该转换的数据库，应将其包含在其各自方言提供的转换中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the converters to be registered.",
      "translation": "返回要注册的转换器。",
      "count": 1
